#: ../../gm0/source/docs/common-mechanisms/active-intake/index.rst:4
msgid "Active Intake"
msgstr "Intake-uri Active"

#: ../../gm0/source/docs/common-mechanisms/active-intake/index.rst:9
msgid "Intake"
msgstr "Intake"

#: ../../gm0/source/docs/common-mechanisms/active-intake/index.rst:9
msgid ""
"A mechanism designed to pick up game elements using some component of "
"rotational motion powered by a motor."
msgstr ""
"Un mecanism cu rolul de a prelua elemente de joc folosind componente în "
"mișcare rotațională, cu ajutorul unui motor."

#: ../../gm0/source/docs/common-mechanisms/active-intake/index.rst:11
msgid ""
"An intake is differentiated from a claw as an intake does not grasp "
"individual game elements using a pinching motion, but rather sucks the "
"element in through a variety of means such as wheels, tubes, etc."
msgstr ""
"Un intake se diferențiază de o gheară deoarece acesta nu apucă elementele "
"individuale ale jocului prin intermediul unei mișcări de \"ciupire\", ci mai"
" degrabă \"aspiră\" elementul printr-o varietate de mijloace, cum ar fi roți"
" moi, tuburi etc.\""

#: ../../gm0/source/docs/common-mechanisms/active-intake/index.rst:15
msgid ""
"While not a necessity, it is highly recommended that teams dedicate at least"
" one motor to their intake if possible."
msgstr ""
"Deși nu este o necesitate, este foarte recomandat ca echipele să dedice cel "
"puțin un motor pentru intake-ul lor, dacă este posibil."

#: ../../gm0/source/docs/common-mechanisms/active-intake/index.rst:24
msgid "FRC 694 StuyPulse, Deep Space"
msgstr "FRC 694 StuyPulse, Deep Space"
